# ImStudium

## Workspace

- Default workspace: `~/Studium` (`IMSTUDIUM_WORKSPACE`)
- Agent entry point: `llms.txt` — navigation + search guidance
- Machine-readable map: `studium.json`
- Exam timeline: `klausuren.md`
- Per-course briefs: `<semesterSlug>/<Course>/COURSE.md`

## Daily loop

```bash
imstudium sync --quiet --extract -o ~/Studium
imstudium setup status
```

Re-run agent wiring after upgrades: `imstudium setup all -y`

## MCP tools (use in order)

`studium_overview` → `studium_klausuren` → **grep/semantic-search corpus.jsonl** → `studium_find_materials` → `studium_read_material`

`studium_overview` returns `searchGuidance` — use your native grep or codebase search on `corpus.jsonl`.

Other tools: `studium_course_brief`, `imstudium_sync`, `imstudium_sync_dry_run`, `imstudium_list_courses`, `imstudium_whoami`

## Slides and PDFs

One pipeline: pdf-inspector (PDF) + AnyDoc (Office). No Tesseract.

`content.md` is not LaTeX. For formulas/diagrams, open the original under `files/`. Image-only pages are marked `_(image-only page — no text layer)_`.

See `searchGuidance.extractionLimits` on `studium_overview`.

## Exam dates

Dates parsed from achievement text are **unconfirmed** — tell the student to verify in Stud.IP.
